OL,3,GNEWSAOliver Helfrich named as new
OL,4,AAttorney General
OL,5,
OL,6,FOliver Helfrich has been appointed by
OL,7,Fthe King as the Isle of Man's next
OL,8,FAttorney General, the government's most
OL,9,Fsenior legal adviser.
OL,11,FHe succeeds Walter Wannenburgh, who is
OL,12,Fretiring after four years in the job.
OL,14,FHelfrich, who recently represented the
OL,15,FAttorney General's office in the
OL,16,FSummerland inquests appeal, said he
OL,17,Ffelt "extremely privileged" to take up
OL,18,Fthe position and understood the
OL,19,F"importance of this role" and the
OL,20,F"responsibility it carries".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
